{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_07",
  "title": "Soul Spark",
  "storyCode": "FC-7",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f08c3b6baf907e72797b05fe8ea5053531ef0e25632d17bb089c51d52ecdd4e3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Young bard, I cannot give you an answer. Let those who come after give it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, as it just so happens, I have one more matter of vital importance to relay to you all tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "–I'm afraid this will be the Clan of Tarans' final gathering."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Witty Noble",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, now, what are you saying, Your Lordship? Hasn't our cause only just begun?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fret not. It is true that the cause of we Tarans to seek who we are is fresh and anew. What will cease to exist is merely the humble little gathering that I lead as an individual."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Isn't that right, my dear, loyal servant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*cough*, *cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl's Attendant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_418_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My apologies... I'm but a servant. I don't presume to understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl's Attendant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_418_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's snowing heavily outside. Your body is frail... I can ready the car for you at any moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No need."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mr. Williams, would you share a walk with me on this snow-filled day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Plain-Dressed Bard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_239",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It would be my honor. The inn I'm staying in had no firewood to begin with. There isn't much left for the snow to hinder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Really? I see... Yes, I never did prevent City Council from imposing winter taxes on the Taran districts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone deserves at least a warm fire on a chilly day like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Earl of Warwick",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_727_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come. Maybe we can chat some more about your creations, the stories you collected in these villages, and what Tara could—should—have been."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Selmon",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Quiet, did you hear those footsteps? They sound heavy. They'll be pretty tough for soldiers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Selmon",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Move, move, move, this way! We'll hide in the other direction!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The campfire's still burning... I can take a piece of timber as a torch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Selmon",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, I'll go with you to fetch it in a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Selmon",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey! Reed! You hear me?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Reeeeed—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Selmon",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's no response... Quick, hide over here! We'll split into two groups in a minute, then look for her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Selmon",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And even if we can't find her, we need to find Bagpipe and Ch'en!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Special Forces Soldier",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Selmon",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Special Forces Soldier",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You dare interfere with a military operation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Selmon",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Something wrong? If I can't shake you, I'll fight you. Not like I haven't scrapped with you Victorian soldiers before."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "'Reed.'\nCry after cry cuts through the smoke and mist.\nReed knows the way she should go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reed",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They shouldn't be dragged into this conflict. I have to help them—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reed",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Ungh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Unfortunate. A few inches shy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harmonie",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm? I recall having reported to the Leader about this, but not anyone else..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can't possibly be so naive as to think you're the only one in Dublinn to form your own intelligence network."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you're to bring that puppet back, I'm afraid there is no course of action more suitable at present than mobilizing my squadron."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harmonie",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My, how grateful I am, then... Are you seeking to supervise my work? Or is it more that you'd like to eliminate her yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Should she refuse her identity as a shadow, my blade will be faster than your Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've seen how diverse viewpoints can be in this masterless Victoria. There is no need for Dublinn to continue staging such a charade."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reed",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you've come to kill me... does that mean—Dublinn is prepared?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You are the only uncertainty left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought that as a puppet, you would at least learn how to think, <i>at least</i> pretend. I thought you'd have the capacity to set your sights farther. It is disappointing, however, to see your foolish kindness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you had followed the spectre force's code of operation from the start and eliminated all witnesses, things would not have taken one wrong turn after another. The situation we find ourselves in now would never have developed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reed",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A second wound. Far from enough to stop a Draco in her tracks, but I'm sure you know that even though no other Dublinn militant is bound your way, this remains a one-sided battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I cannot see what right you have to instigate this petty coup d'état against the Leader."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heeyy—Helloooo—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(...The Taran civilians are down this direction. If Bagpipe and Reed hear the shouts, they'll definitely break through this way too.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hang in there! I'm coming!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ch'en? Thank god, someone finally responded..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—That was fast! Where did that come from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ch'en Hui-chieh. Superintendent Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ch'en thrusts in the direction of the voice, only to find her blade hitting nothing but thick fog.\nShe feels a chill."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you ever considered the troubles you could bring Wei Yenwu by attacking the Victorian army here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I'm doing this because I want to. What does this have to do with him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm simply rescuing the innocents who were dragged into this conflict. If you're going to criticize my actions from a diplomatic angle, I suggest you reflect on your own first."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You may be attempting to gloss over how complicated these events truly are. That said, I still have a question for you. Take your time to answer, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why did you come to Victoria?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Or perhaps I should ask, who did you come to Victoria for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My upbringing, my family, and my personal grudges have nothing to do with the conflict unfolding before us right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At this moment, no matter what you suspect, I will only answer with the blade I hold in my hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now—\nBack off."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Found you, Mr. Fischer!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't seem to have come for peace talks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dublinn's forces are right before us. I'm sure you know who your enemy is here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, but my mission's to rescue everyone... You had your forces planted in advance, and you've got Arts protection. There's no breakin' through this for us if we don't get rid of the mist."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can try to stop me, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Neutralize her. Don't waste any time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Special Forces Soldier",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Understood!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huff... If only I had some ammo on me. Goin' to be a right pain dealin' with multiple at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "2nd Tempest Platoon member Fiona Young, codename 'Bagpipe.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've read every single report you submitted on the County Hillock Incident. You have my utmost respect for your actions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If at all possible, we should be joining forces, not pointing our weapons at one another."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And considering you're still investigating the truth behind the County Hillock Incident, we can follow standard procedure and interrogate any and all Dublinn personnel we capture here and give you any information you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eh, I'll pass. I'm bad at tellin' if someone's lyin' or not, and I'm not the best at interrogation, either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As a show of sincerity, I can give you a single piece of information right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Redsteel Guard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know who they are, don't you? Now—take notice of the combat style of the Dublinn forces here tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, I think visibility improved a bit just now... I reckon keepin' Originium Arts like this goin' got to take a toll, right?"
