      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not such a toll that it would affect my plan. And I won't allow anyone to get in its way either, of course."
