      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fischer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You could say that this war belongs to we, the intelligence workers... There won't be a single misstep from me. I strive to ensure true war does not break out, and millions continue to live in peace."
